{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-4633-3j49-mh5q","cve_id":"CVE-2026-64647","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-4633-3j49-mh5q","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-4633-3j49-mh5q","summary":"Next.js: Cache confusion of response bodies for requests with bodies containing invalid UTF-8 byte sequences","description":"## Impact\n\nA server-side `fetch` with a request body may return a cached **response** body from a different request to the same URL but different body. Confidential data in the `POST`'s **response** body would then leak to unauthorized requests. Though the request itself will not be deduped.\n\nThis is only an issue when receiving request bodies with a content type charset other than UTF-8. For example, the UTF-16 byte sequences for `삃삃` and `섄섄` in the request body would share the same cache.\n\n## Workarounds\n\nIf you cannot upgrade, consider only making fetch requests with UTF-8 bodies (default in Next.js). Applications using Pages Router are not vulnerable.","type":"reviewed","severity":"medium","repository_advisory_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/security-advisories/GHSA-4633-3j49-mh5q","source_code_location":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-4633-3j49-mh5q","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-64647","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://github.com/vercel/next.js/security/advisories/GHSA-4633-3j49-mh5q","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/96008","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/025bf4a5f7b47fb7758c4ebf1c931a61c451c082","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v15.5.21","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v16.2.11","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-4633-3j49-mh5q"],"published_at":"2026-07-22T23:06:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T23:06:14Z","github_reviewed_at":"2026-07-22T23:06:12Z","nvd_published_at":null,"withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"npm","name":"next"},"vulnerable_version_range":">= 13.0.0, < 15.5.21","first_patched_version":"15.5.21","vulnerable_functions":[]},{"package":{"ecosystem":"npm","name":"next"},"vulnerable_version_range":">= 16.0.0, < 16.2.11","first_patched_version":"16.2.11","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":null,"score":0.0},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N","score":6.3}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-116","name":"Improper Encoding or Escaping of Output"}],"credits":[{"user":{"login":"yorukot","id":107802416,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmzvMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107802416?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot","html_url":"https://github.com/yorukot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorukot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"type":"reporter"}],"comments":1,"epss":{"percentage":0.00317,"percentile":0.22557}}